<figure class="mw-halign-right" typeof="mw:File/Thumb"><a href="/wiki/File:Jampilen_Petrochemical_Co._02.jpg" class="mw-file-description"><img src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/38/Jampilen_Petrochemical_Co._02.jpg/300px-Jampilen_Petrochemical_Co._02.jpg" decoding="async" width="300" height="200" class="mw-file-element" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/38/Jampilen_Petrochemical_Co._02.jpg/450px-Jampilen_Petrochemical_Co._02.jpg 1.5x, //upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/38/Jampilen_Petrochemical_Co._02.jpg/600px-Jampilen_Petrochemical_Co._02.jpg 2x" data-file-width="6048" data-file-height="4032" /></a><figcaption>Jampilen Petrochemical co., <a href="/wiki/Asaluyeh" title="Asaluyeh">Asaluyeh</a>, <a href="/wiki/Iran" title="Iran">Iran</a></figcaption></figure>
<p>The <b>petrochemical industry</b> is concerned with the production and trade of <a href="/wiki/Petrochemicals" class="mw-redirect" title="Petrochemicals">petrochemicals</a>.<sup class="noprint Inline-Template" style="margin-left:0.1em; white-space:nowrap;">&#91;<i><a href="/wiki/Wikipedia:Manual_of_Style/Words_to_watch#Unsupported_attributions" title="Wikipedia:Manual of Style/Words to watch"><span title="The material near this tag may use weasel words or too-vague attribution. (November 2024)">according to whom?</span></a></i>&#93;</sup> A major part is constituted by the <a href="/wiki/Plastics_industry" title="Plastics industry">plastics (polymer) industry</a>.<sup class="noprint Inline-Template" style="margin-left:0.1em; white-space:nowrap;">&#91;<i><a href="/wiki/Wikipedia:Manual_of_Style/Words_to_watch#Unsupported_attributions" title="Wikipedia:Manual of Style/Words to watch"><span title="The material near this tag may use weasel words or too-vague attribution. (November 2024)">according to whom?</span></a></i>&#93;</sup> It directly interfaces with the <a href="/wiki/Petroleum_industry" title="Petroleum industry">petroleum industry</a>, especially the <a href="/wiki/Downstream_(petroleum_industry)" title="Downstream (petroleum industry)">downstream</a> sector.<sup class="noprint Inline-Template" style="margin-left:0.1em; white-space:nowrap;">&#91;<i><a href="/wiki/Wikipedia:Manual_of_Style/Words_to_watch#Unsupported_attributions" title="Wikipedia:Manual of Style/Words to watch"><span title="The material near this tag may use weasel words or too-vague attribution. (November 2024)">according to whom?</span></a></i>&#93;</sup>
</p>
